// Blinq Scribe design tokens. The one place colors, type, spacing, radii, shadows, layers and
// motion are decided. Plain data, no DOM: the web app reads it as CSS (css/*.css, generated by
// scripts/generate.ts) and a React Native app can read the same object.

// Aligned with the startup's design system (its Colors, Typography and Elevation pages). Each
// token names its design system twin; where a value differs on purpose, the comment says why.

